{"parse": {"title": "ASD-06", "pageid": 55178, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-05\" title=\"ASD-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">ASD-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-07\" title=\"ASD-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">ASD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.95.9C.E4.B8.AD.E7.9A.84.E5.91.BD.E8.BF.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"镜中的命运\">镜中的命运</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 镜中的命运</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_baoyu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_baoyu\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_baoyu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_baoyu.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_baoyu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_baoyu.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_baoyu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_baoyu.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_baoyu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>歇斯底里的呐喊声，人群的尖叫声，玻璃的破碎声，刺耳的枪声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被“暴雨症候”所感染的人群涌上街头，他们已经失去了理智，只剩下无穷无尽的狂热。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鲜血与颜料，共同勾勒出这幅巨作。它高悬于穹顶，如同艺术家的壁画。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯来到了街道上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手里是一张纸条，那是她在身上衣服的口袋里翻找出来的，记录了罗蕾莱所在地点的纸条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——从一开始，瓦伦缇娜就将记录了罗蕾莱所在地点的纸条放在了这套衣服之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯并不清楚对方的真实用意为何，但她也无从得知了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>滴滴——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>塞梅尔维斯，司辰已经发布了“暴雨”24小时预警。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>距离你最近的撤离点是维也纳车站，在完成必要的善后工作后立即撤离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-308810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-308810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-308810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……我知道了，感谢您的提醒，琳赛女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>尽管为时尚早，但我受命将这个好消息通知给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>拉普拉斯科算中心已经对你的血液完成了解析工作，这意味着他们很快便能够制作出相应的抑制血清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>——你应该知道该怎么做了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>不要浪费我的时间，也不要浪费你自己的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……谢谢您，琳赛女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琳赛女士未做回应，只是单方面地结束了通讯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>这次的“暴雨症候”比以往的任何一次都要有趣得多，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝拉悄然出现在了塞梅尔维斯的身旁，比以往的任何一次都要更加轻易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我很想同意你的观点。不过，这一次的“暴雨症候”中可不包含不请自来的幻觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>我的出现，意味着超自然者的血脉正在改变着你的精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>这种改变伴随着撕裂与重组，而我便是被撕裂出来的那部分存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>而作为你的另外一部分，我想我应该有权利对你的行为提出异议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>很遗憾，基金会的法律并没有规定精神分裂者的“幻觉”的相应权利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>不过，尽管我并不愿意听取你的意见，但我无法阻止你说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>我知道你的打算，你想要去寻找罗蕾莱，从她那里获取完成转化的方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>武器的魅力正是来源于它的危险与便利。在品尝到了那些高效的杀戮兵器所带来的便捷后，又怎么会放弃使用它们呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>神秘术也不例外，它在危险与便利之上又增加了一层由非理性所带来的“未知”，这便构成了神秘术的魅力所在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>所以，你既不想放弃生命，也不想放弃一直以来所追寻的神秘术——相当贪婪的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>瓦伦缇娜已经死了，我不存在其他的选择了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>不，“暴雨”来临之前，你的一举一动都会被基金会实时监控。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>你前去寻找罗蕾莱的行为也必然会被基金会所知……即便如此，你还是坚持要去寻找那名神秘学家吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>你甚至连她是否真的具有治疗你的办法都不清楚——要知道，那个血食怪可没有说实话的义务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>或许这同样也只是一个陷阱，如同当初你被感染的陷阱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>时间还来得及，足够我找到罗蕾莱并撤——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>基金会会将这种行为视作背叛的，塞梅尔维斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我做过许多选择，它们有好有坏。但无一例外的是，我所做过的一切——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>都只是为了掌握我的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我很清楚我并不特别，我没有人类的理性智慧，也不会使用神秘学家应有的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我夹在两者的中间，是一个格格不入的流浪者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>很显然，我对基金会没有那么重要，我对重塑之手没有那么重要，我对瓦伦缇娜没有那么重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我不愿意将我的命运交于任何一个人手上——我所相信的，唯有我自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-308816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝拉：</div><div>看来你的心意已决。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "ASD-06"}}